          "english": "Yes. I have two younger sisters."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "A",
          "hanzi": "你有哥哥吗？",
          "pinyin": "Nǐ yǒu gēge ma?",
          "english": "Do you have an older brother?"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "B",
          "hanzi": "没有。我家有五口人。",
          "pinyin": "Méiyǒu. Wǒ jiā yǒu wǔ kǒu rén.",
          "english": "No. There are five people in my family."
